DTC detecting condition
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Trouble area
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
C1003-01: Warning Buzzer Malfunction
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
This DTC is detected if any one of the following conditions is met.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Parking sensor buzzer drive circuit is shorted to ground, shorted to power supply or open.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Sonar control module internal failure.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Parking sensor buzzer circuit / connector
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Parking sensor buzzer
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Sonar control module
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfosub>
